   ],
   "html": [
    {
     "lang": "en-US",
     "message": "<ul><li><strong>Spacing scale:</strong> 4/8/12/16/24/32</li><li>Keep vertical rhythm consistent across sections and components.</li><li>Align columns and modules to a predictable grid; avoid ad-hoc offsets.</li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "lang": "pt-BR",
     "message": "<ul><li><strong>Escala de espaçamento:</strong> 4/8/12/16/24/32</li><li>Mantenha o ritmo vertical consistente entre seções e componentes.</li><li>Alinhe colunas e módulos a um grid previsível; evite deslocamentos improvisados.</li></ul>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "layout-composition",
   "title": [
